    { "id": "note-admin-mobile", "x": 0, "y": 3868, "w": 390, "text": "Admin at mobile width: the sidebar collapses into a top hamburger (opens the same nav as a drawer) plus a bottom bar for the 4 most-used sections. Stat grid goes 4→2 columns; the orders table becomes stacked cards. Every admin screen follows this same collapse." },
