    { "id": "group-auth", "x": 0, "y": 3948, "w": 900, "text": "Auth & entry — staff only. Same Login layout for Tenant Admin / Waiter / Kitchen sign-in, reached at each tenant's own /{tenantSlug}/...​/login URL so the branding here is resolved from the URL, never picked by the user (Platform Admin swaps the tenant logo for platform branding at its own unscoped /platform/login). Customer never sees a login screen — QR Landing → Menu is the entire entry flow, kiosk-style: no account, no password." },
